# Allow only release source and public examples. Never send datasets, credentials,
# captured screenshots, checkpoints, .git, virtualenvs or submodules as context.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!minizoo.py
!requirements.txt
!CITATION.cff
!docs/
docs/**
!docs/DOCKER.md
